	Finding this group has renewed my interest in nethack.  When I used to
play it about a year ago a strange and humorous thing happened to me and I was wondering if anyone could explain it or has it happen to them. During one of my
sessions, the process for nethack accidentally got killed while I was fighting
an imp.  I hadn't thought much of it, but for the next few days I recieved messages like "Death, Doom, and the Dog await ye" or "quit now while you still can", at random intervals on my work station. I thought someone was messing me.  After a while it occured to me that these were messages that appear when you are fighting an imp ( I may have remembered the wrong creature).  So, I went back into the game, found an imp and killed it, and that was the end of the messages. Do I have an over active imagination







, or did this really happen. 


